<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{!submitted}}"><view class="eyebrow">ANONYMOUS APPLICATION</view><view class="title">申请关怀包</view><view class="subtitle">只填写演示所需信息，不需要真实姓名。</view><view class="form card"><view class="form-label">学校名称 <text>用于模拟分区</text></view><input placeholder="例如：希望中学" data-field="school" bindinput="update" /><view class="form-label">年级 <text>用于了解需求</text></view><input placeholder="例如：初二" data-field="grade" bindinput="update" /><view class="form-label">困难情况简述 <text>可选</text></view><textarea placeholder="可以简单说说你需要怎样的帮助" data-field="note" bindinput="update"></textarea></view><view class="safe-note">隐私说明：本页面为本地演示，不会上传任何真实信息。正式项目将仅用于物资寄送。</view><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="submit">提交模拟申请</button></view>
  <view wx:else class="success"><view class="success-mark">✓</view><view class="success-title">申请已提交</view><view class="subtitle">这是一次本地模拟提交，请保存申请编号。</view><view class="code-card card"><view class="code-label">你的申请编号</view><view class="code">{{application.code}}</view><view class="status-pill">{{application.status}}</view></view><view class="safe-note">正式项目中可凭申请编号查询审核与寄送进度。</view><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="backHome">返回首页</button></view>
</view>
